<mxCell id="flow" value="&lt;b&gt;Main flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① Owner submits a use case in the web app&lt;br&gt;② Event written to the outbox; router opens a terminal run&lt;br&gt;③ Workflow builds the context pack; the agent produces artifacts using models and MCP tools&lt;br&gt;④ Policy engine runs checks; reviewer agent recommends&lt;br&gt;⑤ Owner signs off, or answers a clarification, in the inbox&lt;br&gt;⑥ Ledger record and next event written in one transaction" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=12;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="960" width="330" height="185" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
